            "review_title": "Review at Dubai Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Seaside30452304959\n37 contributions\n0\nDelicious Local Food\nDec 2024 • Solo\nThis is one of few restaurants that opens during low seasons. This family run restaurant offers a pretty international menu, but if you stick to the local Vietnamese food, then you are assured with competitive local food pricing, and super delicious local food - quite a few dishes are the beast I have found in Vietnam.\n\nDuring low season, do be patient as you want the best prepared food by The Chef.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nStick to Vietnamese Food\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 28, 2024",
